{"schema":"mcpgit.table-batch-transaction.v1","transaction_id":"64429ee9-1eb4-5d40-8029-e93167001b71","idempotency_key":"64429ee9-1eb4-5d40-8029-e93167001b71","actor":{"kind":"github-action","repository":"yxsicd/agentlabrelease","runId":"36620658559","runUrl":"https://github.com/yxsicd/agentlabrelease/actions/runs/36620658559"},"recorded_at_unix_ms":1790711146581,"tables":[{"path":"program_facts","operations":[{"op":"insert","operation_id":"e166f6dc-fd7c-59e5-bb12-d2566f7dbd4a","key":"agent-analysis-common-platform-services-account-push-update-utility-contract","row":{"id":"agent-analysis-common-platform-services-account-push-update-utility-contract","kind":"analysis","payload":{"agentProposal":{"automaticPromotion":false,"schema":"agentlab.maintainer_skill_fact_proposal.v1","sourceAssessmentSha256":"5666182d7e425df022e95b19c46e59bb9affc1637eb8cd988d4789d093903e2b"},"dimensions":["behavior","boundary","relations","responsibility"],"evidence":[{"gitBlobOid":"7030f39b70c0f00a616f9530b73def8625c755c3","path":"common/src/main/ets/accountservice/AccountService.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"2fdb138c97d9e0282292c0af3d80ce2b41553a00","path":"common/src/main/ets/pushservice/PushServiceManager.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"13f28378ed4e7a62de27f6d9d7460dbd062b9762","path":"common/src/main/ets/util/index.ets"}],"id":"agent-analysis-common-platform-services-account-push-update-utility-contract","interpretation":"Scope owns the common module's platform-service layer: AccountService (lazy singleton over AccountKit HuaweiID auth), PushServiceManager plus PushService (notification-enable and push-token upload), UpdateService (AppGallery update check/dialog), and ~35 static utility adapters under util re-exported through the index.ets barrel. Observable behavior: serviceInit() subscribes to distributed-account login/logout common events, restores the persisted UserAccount from PreferenceManager key 'userAccount', queries HuaweiIDProvider state and resolves InitResult{isLogin,needUpdate}; login() runs a forced authorization (profile scope, serviceauthcode, PS256, random state checked against response state); logout paths clear nickname/unionId/avatarUrl, persist 'userLogin', and emit BIND_LOGOUT_EVENT. PushServiceManager requests notification enable then posts pushService.getToken() to PushService, a stub resolving true. UpdateService guards canIUse, derives UIAbilityContext from AppStorage UI_CONTEXT, and rejects BusinessError-like objects when context or capability is missing. Public boundary: singleton classes and stateless static utils exposing Promise<boolean>, InitResult, PushTokenParams; cross-boundary relations import out-of-scope storagemanager/PreferenceManager and constant/CommonConstants event ids. Maintenance contract: preserve singleton semantics, emitted events, preference keys, TAG-prefixed hilog logging (domain 0xFF00, prefix '[HMOSWorld]'), login state validation, and the index.ets barrel; PushService.postPushToken is an intentional integration seam.","kind":"analysis","limitations":["PushService.postPushToken resolves true without network I/O; whether products replace this seam or tokens are actually uploaded is not provable from these blobs.","PreferenceManager.getValue is cast to UserAccount without schema validation; persisted-shape compatibility across app versions is claimed, not runtime-verified."],"repositoryId":"code-workshop","scopeSkillIds":["skill-scope-code-workshop-common-platform-services"],"sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"},"payloadSha256":"27b633a00cfa03a09a734bc0e1798014403ccbb37f11f699d915d7b1cee5c0da","repositoryId":"code-workshop","sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"}},{"op":"insert","operation_id":"2d80de65-3f2a-53ef-92dd-2810febf19a7","key":"agent-analysis-dialog-overlay-example-triad-pipeline","row":{"id":"agent-analysis-dialog-overlay-example-triad-pipeline","kind":"analysis","payload":{"agentProposal":{"automaticPromotion":false,"schema":"agentlab.maintainer_skill_fact_proposal.v1","sourceAssessmentSha256":"5666182d7e425df022e95b19c46e59bb9affc1637eb8cd988d4789d093903e2b"},"dimensions":["behavior","boundary","relations","responsibility"],"evidence":[{"gitBlobOid":"6e937d9b422732ad1f205bf33a7bece6680aa737","path":"features/componentlibrary/src/main/ets/componentdetailview/actionsheetview/component/ActionSheetBuilder.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"0180061de8480df21465a7254bd9bb7d7f25f31b","path":"features/componentlibrary/src/main/ets/componentdetailview/customdialog/component/CustomDialogComponent.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"d06980a26c9095d12857f370062b26b10c0f5ed6","path":"features/componentlibrary/src/main/ets/viewmodel/CommonDescriptor.ets"}],"id":"agent-analysis-dialog-overlay-example-triad-pipeline","interpretation":"Five sibling overlay families (actionsheetview, alertdialogview, customdialog, popup, textpickerdialogview) repeat one triad: a @Builder/struct UI entry that opens a system overlay from a button click, an entity Map translating UI labels into ArkUI values or code snippets, and a viewmodel pair where an @Observed Descriptor extends CommonDescriptor and overrides convert(attributes: OriginAttribute[]) while a CodeGenerator implements CommonCodeGenerator.generate, returning a self-contained ArkTS sample string. Observable contract: overlay options (autoCancel, asymmetric transitions, sheetInfo, placement, canLoop, itemHeight, dialog style) come only from descriptor fields; convert switch-maps recognized names ('type', 'placement', 'dialogAlignment') and unknown names or unmapped values fall back via '?? this.x' and DEFAULT_KEY map entries. ActionSheetBuilder resolves UIContext from AppStorage (StorageKey.UI_CONTEXT) for showActionSheet; TextPickerDialogBuilder uses getUIContext().showTextPickerDialog with Toast accept/cancel callbacks; CustomDialogComponent owns two CustomDialogControllers (TipsDialog, CustomContentDialog from @kit.ArkUI), permits PRESS_BACK/TOUCH_OUTSIDE dismissal in onWillDismiss, picks a controller by descriptor.style, and nulls both controllers in aboutToDisappear. Public boundary: exported builders/structs, @Observed descriptor classes, CommonCodeGenerator implementations, and exported Map constants; cross-boundary bases CommonDescriptor/DescriptorWrapper plus @ohos/common (Toast, Logger, StorageKey). Maintenance duty: keep descriptor fields, mapping keys, and emitted snippets synchronized per family.","kind":"analysis","limitations":["Runtime invocation of UIContext.showActionSheet/showAlertDialog and Toast display is unverified; no device or emulator execution evidence exists in this tree.","DescriptorWrapper consumers outside this scope that register these builders and descriptors were not inspected, so page-level integration is inferred from type usage alone."],"repositoryId":"code-workshop","scopeSkillIds":["skill-scope-code-workshop-componentlibrary-dialog-overlays"],"sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"},"payloadSha256":"cc80d0942282d148bea856087596840b31e0747f1217b38a642e30dac8104a4e","repositoryId":"code-workshop","sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"}},{"op":"insert","operation_id":"5b606c58-b1a8-5aba-be71-cb147f9c8da9","key":"agent-analysis-kit-demo-builders-and-attribute-descriptor-pipeline","row":{"id":"agent-analysis-kit-demo-builders-and-attribute-descriptor-pipeline","kind":"analysis","payload":{"agentProposal":{"automaticPromotion":false,"schema":"agentlab.maintainer_skill_fact_proposal.v1","sourceAssessmentSha256":"5666182d7e425df022e95b19c46e59bb9affc1637eb8cd988d4789d093903e2b"},"dimensions":["behavior","boundary","relations","responsibility"],"evidence":[{"gitBlobOid":"5660e48d2180ec279a20631c04993e4c1cd2b2fc","path":"features/componentlibrary/src/main/ets/componentdetailview/texttospeech/component/TextToSpeechBuilder.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"ee8751f6a5523d1307672515566355cfdda76938","path":"features/componentlibrary/src/main/ets/componentdetailview/Image/viewmodel/ImageCodeGenerator.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"d06980a26c9095d12857f370062b26b10c0f5ed6","path":"features/componentlibrary/src/main/ets/viewmodel/CommonDescriptor.ets"}],"id":"agent-analysis-kit-demo-builders-and-attribute-descriptor-pipeline","interpretation":"This scope maintains nine component-detail demos under componentdetailview, built as two coupled mechanisms. (1) Demo UI layer: exported @Builder factories (PhotoViewPickerBuilder, TextToSpeechBuilder, AICaptionBuilder, PenKitViewBuilder, AIImageBuilder, etc.) each take a DescriptorWrapper {descriptor: CommonDescriptor} and mount a private @Component exercising one platform kit: PhotoViewPicker.select (IMAGE_TYPE, maxSelectNumber 1) updates selected-URI state and blur; CoreSpeechKit createEngine('zh-CN') plus a SpeakListener drives AppStorage IS_PLAYING and stops/shutdowns the engine on stop or aboutToDisappear; AICaption streams a bundled PCM resource into AICaptionController.writeAudio in 640-byte chunks paced by promise sleeps with timeout cleanup; Penkit loads 'savePath' on init and saves it on disappear; ImageKit enableAnalyzer pixelmap is released on disappear with a preference-persisted popup. Lifecycle guards (isComponentAlive, engine shutdown, clearTimeout) and BusinessError Logger paths define teardown behavior. (2) Descriptor pipeline: @Observed Descriptor subclasses override CommonDescriptor.convert to map named OriginAttribute values through per-folder entity maps with DEFAULT_KEY fallback; CommonCodeGenerator.generate returns ArkUI snippet strings; CommonAttributeFilter mutates sibling attribute enable flags; CommonAttributeModifier.applyNormalAttribute copies descriptor fields onto attribute instances. Builders and view models depend on the shared ../viewmodel plane (DescriptorWrapper, CommonDescriptor, ComponentDetailManager) and @ohos/common Logger/StorageKey/GlobalInfoModel, so edits there fan out to all nine examples.","kind":"analysis","limitations":["The component-detail registry that instantiates each Builder (ComponentDetailManager/DetailViewModel in ../viewmodel) lies outside this scope; its wiring is assumed from imports, not traced.","Device-level outcomes (TTS audio, picker dialogs, handwriting save persistence) are inferred from API call sites only; no build, runtime, or emulator execution was verified."],"repositoryId":"code-workshop","scopeSkillIds":["skill-scope-code-workshop-componentlibrary-media-platform"],"sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"},"payloadSha256":"6073c652eab3f22c082a28d75a89812cc4c6834023d6fba61eb20063b991e80f","repositoryId":"code-workshop","sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"}},{"op":"insert","operation_id":"d77e6b8a-2c9d-53f4-9767-4340a7881529","key":"agent-analysis-rdb-preference-telemetry-pipeline","row":{"id":"agent-analysis-rdb-preference-telemetry-pipeline","kind":"analysis","payload":{"agentProposal":{"automaticPromotion":false,"schema":"agentlab.maintainer_skill_fact_proposal.v1","sourceAssessmentSha256":"5666182d7e425df022e95b19c46e59bb9affc1637eb8cd988d4789d093903e2b"},"dimensions":["behavior","boundary","relations","responsibility"],"evidence":[{"gitBlobOid":"f08fe1b07eeacf265e9ba446190e337a76a529fd","path":"common/src/main/ets/trackmanager/TrackManager.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"6efc1a886b442fcb8e2a99140e73c02e3e5b6ce2","path":"common/src/main/ets/storagemanager/rdb/TrackTable.ets"},{"gitBlobOid":"9edc9ee35f6dbacaf238d0b94bbbb4c505cfdfea","path":"common/src/main/ets/model/TrackModel.ets"}],"id":"agent-analysis-rdb-preference-telemetry-pipeline","interpretation":"This scope owns HMOS World's persistence and telemetry: two RDB stacks plus a preference store feeding a click/exposure pipeline. TrackManager (singleton) resets preference key APP_TRACK_DATA, builds TrackCommonData from AppStorage BUNDLE_INFO and deviceInfo, opens TrackTable, and registers UIObserver 'willClick' and 'navDestinationSwitch' listeners; reportData stamps time and inserts TrackServiceData, and a 60s interval queries all rows, wraps them in TrackModel, posts via TrackService.postTrackData, then deletes all rows on success or above 1000 buffered rows. TrackTable maps TrackServiceData to ValuesBucket with null-coalescing and back via sealData; RdbStore opens 'hmosWorldDatabase.db' (S1), creates the 13-column trackTable, runs insert/delete/query in @Concurrent taskpool tasks typed by TableTypeEnum, returning [] on query failure. Separately, database/FormRdbHelper (singleton over RdbUtils, 'database.db' S1) CRUDs FormInfoTable; PreferenceManager ('HMosWorldStoreWithNet') stores JSON-stringified values with one re-init retry and deletes keys whose JSON fails to parse; PreferenceCacheHelper layers Record sub-key get/set; MockRequest serves rawfile mock JSON. Cross-boundary: TrackServiceData/TrackModel/TrackEventType come from ../model/TrackModel.ets. Contract: keep store names, security levels, null-vs-absent bucket semantics and the sqlite_sequence reset stable; TrackService.postTrackData is a true-resolving stub whose real upload must preserve delete-only-on-success.","kind":"analysis","limitations":["TrackService.postTrackData resolving true is assumed to be a placeholder for an unimplemented upload endpoint; no network, server, or dispatch behavior is provable from this source tree.","FormRdbHelper.queryFormById and queryForm leave their Promises unresolved on error or empty results; whether callers guard against this hang is not evidenced here."],"repositoryId":"code-workshop","scopeSkillIds":["skill-scope-code-workshop-common-persistence-telemetry"],"sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"},"payloadSha256":"37ae5e57d3110db5463ddacb9adad2cae237b13cedc392f853ed3f0d647174a0","repositoryId":"code-workshop","sourceRevision":"7aa95cac4eca15e39fc6638cdf1de7db6fb70ad6"}}],"results":[{"operation_id":"e166f6dc-fd7c-59e5-bb12-d2566f7dbd4a","op":"insert","key":"agent-analysis-common-platform-services-account-push-update-utility-contract","previous_row_version":null,"row_version":1,"deleted":false},{"operation_